     - Hydrogen: Using high-hydrogen content feedstocks (e.g., steam reforming with high-carbon content fuels) can improve hydrogen yield.
     - Oxygen and Nitrogen: Ensuring the feed air is clean and dry can improve the efficiency of air separation processes.
