   - Co-production: Integrating the production of hydrogen, oxygen, and nitrogen with other industrial processes can help reduce overall energy consumption and reduce waste.
   - Waste Recycling: Using waste gases as fuel or as feedstocks for other processes can help reduce waste and improve overall efficiency.

