- **a. \( [ML^2T^{-2}] \)**: This is the dimensional representation of force, not friction.  
- **b. \( [MLT^{-2}] \)**: This is also the dimensional representation of force.  
- **d. \( [ML^{-1}] \)**: This does not represent a physical quantity in the context of friction.  

