$$ P(k \geq 9) = 220 \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{12} + 66 \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{12} + 12 \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{12} + 1 \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{12} = \left(220 + 66 + 12 + 1\right) \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{12} $$
