\[
\frac{AD}{\sin 30^\circ} = \frac{BD}{\sin \angleBAD} \implies BD = \frac{AD \sin \angleBAD}{\sin 30^\circ} = 2AD \sin \angleBAD.
\]

Using the Law of Sines in triangle $BCD$:
\[
