- \( R = 2 \, \text{cal K}^{-1} \text{mol}^{-1} \)

\[
E_a = \frac{\ln \left( \frac{10^4}{10^{-1}} \right)}{\frac{1}{833} - \frac{1}{1000}}
\]

\[
E_a = \frac{\ln (10^5)}{\frac{1}{833} - \frac{1}{1000}}
\]

\[
E_a = \frac{15}{0.001203 - 0.001}
\]

\[
E_a = \frac{15}{0.000203}
\]

\[
