","To estimate the contribution of the hard particles to the tensile yield strength \(\sigma_{yr}\) of the alloy, we use the Oagger-Taylor model. The Oagger-Taylor model accounts for the interaction between dislocations and obstacles (e.g., hard particles) in the material.

